Third-party data are not redistributed under this licence. This repository is
the analysis-code deposit: it contains the analysis scripts, the frozen rule
documents, the run and provenance records, the software-environment records and
the small errata tables the reading guide refers to. It does not contain the
machine-readable result tables, which are published with the paper as its
Additional files 2-4. The upstream datasets remain governed by the terms of
their own repositories, listed in `README.md` and in the manuscript's data
availability statement.
